erence pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 10.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Photorealistic live-action, cinematic, one continuous shot in a warm and cozy East Asian young woman's bedroom with a soft pink, creamy-white and lightly lavender anime-inspired interior. A young East Asian woman with long straight black hair sleeps peacefully on the bed, wearing a loose oversized pastel-pink pajama top. A cute short-haired black-and-white cow cat with black ears, a mostly black back and tail, a white forehead stripe, white muzzle, white chest, four white paws and bright yellow eyes stands near the foot of the bed while carrying a small soft gray toy mouse in its mouth. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as the cat looks toward the sleeping woman and prepares to wake her.\n\nFrom 00:01.500 to 00:03.500, the cat jumps lightly onto the bed and walks across the soft blanket toward the woman, while the bedding compresses naturally under its paws. From 00:03.500 to 00:05.200, the cat places the gray toy mouse near the woman's hand and gently nudges her fingers with its nose. From 00:05.200 to 00:07.800, the woman slowly wakes, sits slightly upright and reaches toward the cat. The young woman with a soft, sleepy and affectionate voice (S1) looks at the cat and says: <d>[Chinese] 早安呀，小黑白，你又比我早醒呀！</d> From 00:07.800 to 00:09.000, she lifts the cat into her arms, and the cat presses its cheek against her chin while resting its front paws on her pink pajama top. During the final second, the woman settles against the headboard while holding the relaxed cat, and the gray toy mouse remains visible beside them on the bed. The woman, cat, clothing, bedding, lighting, camera angle, spatial relationships and overall composition converge precisely to Picture 2 at the 10.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soun